{
  "sourceVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
  "checkedAtUTC": "2026-10-16T07:05:38Z",
  "primaryTextRead": [
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-2-1",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH02.htm#V1",
      "text": "These are the sons of Israel: Reuben, Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Zebulun,",
      "textSHA256": "ca540a9538ec383bddfdda06d66530873044633a8bfe3c1b20536e19ceb430c2"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-6-1",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V1",
      "text": "The sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari.",
      "textSHA256": "f0d255e4b9978f73512129777a835fd7d2e32a863ae6ff1f336fda45032f1d94"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-6-16",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V16",
      "text": "The sons of Levi: Gershom, Kohath, and Merari.",
      "textSHA256": "e0d50474a9313e491ea3bdcb3eaee2a8cffe6c38a988df4e92d506a5ebaef35f"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-6-38",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V38",
      "text": "the son of Izhar, the son of Kohath, the son of Levi, the son of Israel.",
      "textSHA256": "2f4a7b58b0994c4ecf3f958335ca120f2b78dec4bd24d72cebf981c298169411"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-6-43",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V43",
      "text": "the son of Jahath, the son of Gershom, the son of Levi.",
      "textSHA256": "accec93329087ec7cc4a7fd89d380ff12039bc49df7e89221990676d33e705b0"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-6-47",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH06.htm#V47",
      "text": "the son of Mahli, the son of Mushi, the son of Merari, the son of Levi.",
      "textSHA256": "61fb610384a1dd318af43b1aaad951f122a0ae818046a4ae3287a1c3156e9c6d"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-9-18",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH09.htm#V18",
      "text": "who previously served in the king’s gate eastward. They were the gatekeepers for the camp of the children of Levi.",
      "textSHA256": "524bb9ce39368e0cc36809dc21ba398888ef408fd00bc59ef951e83abc062ff9"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-12-26",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH12.htm#V26",
      "text": "Of the children of Levi: four thousand six hundred.",
      "textSHA256": "a031a333f3c17c64b4937855da1b6f430336ce88ac6236150b63969fa0d8fb29"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-21-6",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH21.htm#V6",
      "text": "But he didn’t count Levi and Benjamin among them, for the king’s word was abominable to Joab.",
      "textSHA256": "c92ac8c553af172ac2dbff5aa4a20aeb0df867ee655f8de958a0936f117380e4"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-23-6",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH23.htm#V6",
      "text": "David divided them into divisions according to the sons of Levi: Gershon, Kohath, and Merari.",
      "textSHA256": "c45dd3bc7468ee034dcaf5d0742c041befb7c57247ffb0e91350d81f18e52f3d"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-23-14",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH23.htm#V14",
      "text": "But as for Moses the man of God, his sons were named among the tribe of Levi.",
      "textSHA256": "4a9a1357fc42580c95662c062c060b5373ed38142d21379eef448bade792dc04"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-23-24",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH23.htm#V24",
      "text": "These were the sons of Levi after their fathers’ houses, even the heads of the fathers’ houses of those who were counted individually, in the number of names by their polls, who did the work for the service of the LORD’s house, from twenty years old and upward.",
      "textSHA256": "1ece862939c31a33e095edd98dc862d81162453a4be6211677cc0f236fcf5a55"
    },
    {
      "sourceId": "webp-1ch-levi_1820-24-20",
      "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH24.htm#V20",
      "text": "Of the rest of the sons of Levi: of the sons of Amram, Shubael; of the sons of Shubael, Jehdeiah.",
      "textSHA256": "151a340154d3752d3e5deff03d697f68fe8f71f6dc8d68a51f2463238d8fc163"
    }
  ],
